menu "SCB PCB V3 wiring"
config SCB_SENSOR_NAMED_WIRING
    bool "Sensor cable is crossed by signal NAME rather than pin number"
    default n
    help
        Default IDC16 pin n to pin n: sensor A0/A1/A2 use GPIO10/9/8.
        Master MUX_IN1/3 names occupy opposite contacts from sensor MUX_IN1/3.
        Enable ONLY for a verified name-crossed cable (sensor A0/A1/A2=8/9/10).
endmenu
